- strB.compareTo(strA) will return a positive value because "Carrot" comes after "CARROT" in lexicographical order.
- strB.compareTo(strC) will return a positive value because "Carrot" comes after "car" in lexicographical order.
- strC.compareTo(strB) will return a negative value because "car" comes before "Carrot" in lexicographical order.

